  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients. Preheat oven to 400F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Line a baking sheet with parchment paper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a saucepan over medium heat, add the sweetener and vanilla extract. Stir twice and let it sit for about 5 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a food processor, add the roasted almonds, pumpkin seeds, flaxseed, roasted pecans, and xanthan gum.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pulse until the nuts are chopped pretty fine.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add almond milk to the sweetener and remove from heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the finely chopped nut mixture and the liquid sweetener.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "With a spatula, spread the nut mixture onto the baking sheet. Press down firmly to form into the pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Score the bars evenly with a sharp knife. Bake in the oven for about 10 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-vegan-granola-bars/#wprm-recipe-54435-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/09/Keto-Vegan-Granola-Bars-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let cool completely before cutting the bars at the score marks. Serve and enjoy!",
